  "notes": [
    "Rename to status.json once Phase 1.5 (tcad_conduct.py) lands.",
    "active_wp is the WP-NNN-slug folder name under .protocol/handoffs/, null when IDLE.",
    "state must be one of the states declared in .protocol/conductor.yaml > state_machine.states.",
    "attempt_count is the FIX_REQUEST cycle count for the current WP; resets on DONE.",
    "open_questions is a list of Q-IDs from .protocol/questions/INDEX.md that block transitions.",
    "history is append-only: { state, timestamp, artifact, agent }.",
    "Phase 1 (current): this file is example-only. Phase 1.5 will create the live status.json."
  ]
}
